    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176830/extras/5ec88e770b0c7efa67ce68cbeee24a42.avif?t=1753298815\" width=512 height=178 /></span><br><br><strong> ...One fateful night, the earth trembled as monsters started flooding the human world!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176830/extras/9e66321d17bd62f7412ce03ac5513cb4.poster.avif?t=1753298815\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176830/extras/9e66321d17bd62f7412ce03ac5513cb4.webm?t=1753298815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176830/extras/9e66321d17bd62f7412ce03ac5513cb4.mp4?t=1753298815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Beat their brains out with your trusty bat!<br>Burn them alive with molotov cocktails!<br>Blast and kill them with a variety of guns!<br><u>Do whatever it takes to survive!</u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176830/extras/3404e80fa8107e27a205d1eaf24103b2.avif?t=1753298815\" width=470 height=512 /></span>",
